<title>POLAND: Polish '96 unemployment 13.6 pct vs 14.9 pct in 95.</title>
<headline>Polish '96 unemployment 13.6 pct vs 14.9 pct in 95.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Registered unemployment in Poland rose to 13.6 percent of the workforce in December from 13.3 percent in November, but was lower than 14.9 percent in 1995, figures from the Central Statistical Office (GUS) show.</p>
</text>
